# Build output. The test binaries have no extension and are named after
# their tests, so rather than a list every new test has to remember to
# extend -- which this file was, and two of its five entries never
# matched -- ignore everything here, then take back what has an
# extension (sources, headers, this file, README), the Makefile and
# fake/. macOS debug bundles have a dot in their name, so they are
# ignored again last.
/*
!/*.*
!/Makefile
!/fake/
/*.dSYM/
